Package: ros-fonts
Version: @VERSION@
Section: fonts
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: fontconfig
Recommends: fonts-noto-core, fonts-dejavu-core
Maintainer: ROS Project <yvesm189@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/yvesm189/ros
Description: ROS brand typefaces
 Funnel Display, the ROS interface font, and Space Grotesk for display text,
 together with the fontconfig rules that make Funnel Display the generic
 sans-serif on a ROS workstation.
 .
 Both are variable fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1. They cover Latin
 and Cyrillic; Noto and DejaVu remain behind them so that text outside that
 coverage still renders.
